; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"408\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">실제 면접상황 연출을 통한 면접 적응력 향상 및 개별 피드백</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"39\" height=\"25\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">3H</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%\">□ 접수방법 : 방문 및 전화접수<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; ※&nbsp;접수시 필요서류 : 졸업증명서 또는 졸업예정증명서</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br>□ 문 의 처 : 054-478-7242</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
